{%- comment -%}
  Conditional quiz branches, as data.

  Why this is a snippet and not more code inside sections/native-quiz-modal
  .liquid: that file is ~48KB, and every wording change to a branch question
  would otherwise mean rewriting and redeploying the whole thing. The same
  pattern is already used for the catalogue and the stack discounts. Content
  lives here; the mechanism that shows and scores it lives in the section.

  Shape of each branch:

    whenGoal   the `key` of a goal-question option. The branch's questions are
               shown only while that option is selected, and their answers are
               discarded the moment it is deselected — a hidden answer must
               never keep scoring.
    weight     how hard this question pushes relative to the others. The goal
               question is 2 and the generic refinement questions are 1; these
               sit at 1.5 because a branch question is asked only of people it
               actually applies to, so its answer is far more diagnostic than a
               catch-all one.
    q / hint / a   identical in shape to the questions in the section, so the
               same renderer and the same scorer handle them with no special
               cases. `w` maps a product handle to a score.

  Every handle below must exist and be ACTIVE in the catalogue. A handle that
  no longer exists silently scores nothing — it will not throw, the branch will
  just quietly stop routing. Check against snippets/spadra-quiz-catalog.liquid
  before renaming anything.

  Wording rule for this branch specifically: these questions are about alcohol,
  which makes them regulated territory. They observe what the shopper reports
  and never promise an outcome — no "prevent", no "cure", no "detox your
  hangover". Keep any new option in that register.
{%- endcomment -%}

<script type="application/json" data-spadra-quiz-branches>
[
  {
    "whenGoal": "social-recovery",
    "weight": 1.5,
    "questions": [
      {
        "q": "How often does a night out actually happen?",
        "hint": "Be honest — frequency changes which protocol fits more than anything else here.",
        "a": [
          {
            "t": "Once or twice a month.",
            "label": "Occasional",
            "w": { "party-pack-1": 8, "party-recovery-spadra": 7, "party-hangover-recovery-pack": 6 }
          },
          {
            "t": "About once a week.",
            "label": "Weekly",
            "w": { "party-recovery-spadra": 8, "party-pack-1": 7, "party-hangover-recovery-pack": 7, "liver-detox-pack-spadra": 4 }
          },
          {
            "t": "Two to four nights a week.",
            "label": "Frequent",
            "w": { "liver-detox-pack-spadra": 9, "party-recovery-spadra": 7, "toxin-detox-pack-1": 5, "antioxidant-pack-spadra": 4 }
          },
          {
            "t": "Most nights — it comes with the job.",
            "label": "Sustained load",
            "w": { "liver-detox-pack-spadra": 10, "toxin-detox-pack-1": 7, "antioxidant-pack-spadra": 5, "methylation-pack-spadra": 4 }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "q": "When do you want the protocol doing its work?",
        "hint": "Before and after are different formulations, not the same one taken twice.",
        "a": [
          {
            "t": "Before and during — I would rather not feel it tomorrow.",
            "label": "Pre-load",
            "w": { "party-pack-1": 10, "liver-detox-pack-spadra": 4 }
          },
          {
            "t": "The morning after — I need to function.",
            "label": "Repair",
            "w": { "party-recovery-spadra": 10, "party-hangover-recovery-pack": 9 }
          },
          {
            "t": "Both. I want the whole arc covered.",
            "label": "Both ends",
            "w": { "party-pack-1": 8, "party-recovery-spadra": 8, "party-hangover-recovery-pack": 6 }
          },
          {
            "t": "Neither, really — I am thinking about the long run.",
            "label": "Long game",
            "w": { "liver-detox-pack-spadra": 10, "toxin-detox-pack-1": 6, "longevity-nad-repair-pack": 4 }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "q": "What actually costs you the most the next day?",
        "hint": "This is the bottleneck the protocol is built around.",
        "a": [
          {
            "t": "My head — fog, flat mood, no deep work in me.",
            "label": "Cognitive",
            "w": { "party-recovery-spadra": 9, "party-hangover-recovery-pack": 8, "brain-pack-1": 5, "focus-pack-spadra": 5, "methylation-pack-spadra": 4 }
          },
          {
            "t": "My gut — nausea, and nothing sits right.",
            "label": "Gastrointestinal",
            "w": { "party-recovery-spadra": 9, "gut-pack-spadra": 7, "microbiome-pack-spadra": 5, "party-hangover-recovery-pack": 5 }
          },
          {
            "t": "My sleep — I am unconscious for eight hours and still wrecked.",
            "label": "Sleep quality",
            "w": { "sleep-pack-1": 8, "sleep-pack-melatonin-spadra": 6, "party-recovery-spadra": 6, "stress-pack-spadra": 4 }
          },
          {
            "t": "Honestly nothing much — the cumulative load is what worries me.",
            "label": "Cumulative load",
            "w": { "liver-detox-pack-spadra": 10, "toxin-detox-pack-1": 7, "antioxidant-pack-spadra": 5 }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
]
</script>
